154
00:12:37.880 --> 00:12:41.240
3.815 metres?

155
00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:44.519
Do you know how far that is?

156
00:12:44.520 --> 00:12:45.839
No.

157
00:12:45.840 --> 00:12:49.064
That's over two -
of your English miles.

158
00:12:49.065 --> 00:12:50.039
Two miles?

159
00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:51.919
